  "comparison_notes": [
    "The api_fields object includes every request argument and every response slot, including product members. It comes from the English interface guide, not property descriptions.",
    "Only literal document rules are asserted; no unspecified numeric-date order, hint reply or callback defaults are guessed.",
    "Absent already-paid and restructuring special-case actions use the existing comparator missing-path sentinel. A paid route must not be invented.",
    "Nearest-cent half-up rounding is explicitly required. The percent IR expresses the percentage but cannot by itself certify tie rounding; inspect the semantic requirement in README. Equivalent per-type expansion of the wildcard floor requires semantic review.",
    "No concrete calendar date occurs in this oracle: holidays are explicitly empty and deadlines are relative rule objects. Therefore there are no expected dates to compute with bankcal. No existing repository file was read, run or imported."
  ]
